  "Description": {
    "DefaultText": "Raises your stress levels if not satisfied.\nCan be satisfied by being in areas with mosquitos, by eating leeches, blood sausages and blood curds or drinking blood. ",
    "Text": "如果得不到满足，将增加你的压力水平。\\n可以通过待在有蚊虫的区域、食用水蛭、血肠和血凝块或饮血得到满足。",
    "zh": "如果得不到满足，将增加你的压力水平。\\n可以通过待在有蚊虫的区域、食用水蛭、血肠和血凝块或饮血得到满足。",
    "en": "Raises your stress levels if not satisfied.\\nCan be satisfied by being in areas with mosquitos, by eating leeches, blood sausages and blood curds or drinking blood. ",
    "ja": "Raises your stress levels if not satisfied.\nCan be satisfied by being in areas with mosquitos, by eating leeches, blood sausages and blood curds or drinking blood. "
